# ── SECRETS — never commit these ────────────────────────────────────────
# The licence signing key. If this reaches the repo, anyone who can see the
# repo can issue licences for any machine and the whole scheme is finished.
# It belongs in GitHub Secrets, not in git. See BUILD-GITHUB.md.
iss-private.pem
*.pem
*.key

# Issued licence files and customer requests — no reason for these in git.
*.isslic
*.issreq

# Generated brand packs (rebuildable from make-brand.js; keep source, not output)
*.issbrand

# ── Build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
out/
node_modules/

# ── Editor / OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
npm-debug.log*
